WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.671
A RUSSIAN MISSILE STRIKE IN AN
APARTMENT BUILDING IN DNIPRO

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:08.775
HAS LEFT 40 PEOPLE DEAD, MAKING
IT ONE OF THE DEADLIEST SINGLE

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:12.779
ATTACKS OF THE WAR.
UKRAINE'S AUTHORITY REPORTS IT

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:17.684
WAS CAUSED BY A MISSILE.
THE ATTACK ON CIVILIAN TARGETS

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:20.086
COMES AT A MAKE-OR-BREAK MOMENT
IN THIS LONG VICIOUS WAR.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:23.756
DESPITE EARLIER RUSSIAN CLAIMS
A VICTORY, UKRAINE SAYS THERE

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.693
IS CONTINUED FEARS AND ONGOING
FIGHTING FOR THE RUSSIAN TOWN

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:31.698
OF SOLID ON.
AND THEY FEAR THAT PUTIN WILL

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.967
FIND SOME EXCUSE TO TRY TO
REINVADE FROM THE NORTH.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:38.071
THE MILITARY WARNS THAT THE
COMBAT TRAILS THAT BEGAN TODAY

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.874
BETWEEN RUSSIA AND BELARUS
PRESENT A CLEAR DANGER.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:44.043
MEANWHILE, MORE WESTERN ALLIES,
INCLUDING BRITAIN, FRANCE AND

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:48.014
POLAND PROMISED TO SEND TANKS
AND OTHER ADVANCED WEAPONS.

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:51.184
BUT, IS IT HAPPENING FAST
ENOUGH?

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:57.056
TO HELP UKRAINE DEFEND ITSELF
TO HELP A RUSSIAN OFFENSE OF

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:59.726
THE SPRING.
WE HAVE A TOP AIDE TO PRESIDENT

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:03.696
ZELENSKYY AND HIS CHIEF
DIPLOMATIC JOINING ME NOW FROM

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.998
KYIV.
WELCOME TO THE PROGRAM.

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:11.771
AS WE SPEAK, YOUR RESCUE CREWS
ARE STILL DIGGING OUT THAT

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:15.975
APARTMENT BUILDING IN DNIPRO.
DO YOU KNOW THE NUMBER OF DEAD?

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:22.748
DO YOU THINK IT WILL GO HIGHER?
&gt;&gt; UNFORTUNATELY, CHRISTIANA,

00:01:22.748 --> 00:01:27.654
WE CAN PREDICT THAT THE NUMBER
OF DEATHS WILL GO HIGHER AS OF

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:31.757
NOW, WHICH IS 40.
THEY HAVE REPORTED OVER 70

00:01:31.757 --> 00:01:37.797
WOUNDED, BUT ALMOST 40 ARE NOT
YET FOUND AND THE RESCUE TEAMS

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:46.806
ARE WORKING DAY AFTER DAY, AND
UNFORTUNATELY IT COULD BE EVEN

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:50.043
WORSE.
&gt;&gt; THIS WAS ACCORDING TO YOUR

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:53.813
MILITARY ANALYSIS OF CRUISE
MISSILE SENT TO RUSSIA.

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:56.216
DO YOU EXPECT THAT TO BE THE
NORM?

00:01:56.216 --> 00:02:01.854
DO YOU EXPECT MORE OF THAT
AGAINST THOSE KIND OF CIVILIAN

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:03.956
AND RESIDENTIAL BUILDINGS?
THEY HAVE DONE AND THEY

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:06.726
CONTINUE TO DO INFRASTRUCTURE,
DO YOU SEE IT MOVING NOW

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:10.763
TOWARDS ACTUAL CIVILIAN
RESIDENCES AND SUCH?

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:16.736
&gt;&gt; UNFORTUNATELY, IT IS MOVING
THAT WAY.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:21.674
SWABBING BEEN NOT ABLE TO
ACHIEVE ANY SUCCESS IN THE

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:24.744
BATTLEFIELD, THEY STARTED TO
MOVE IN OUR ENERGY

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:27.680
INFRASTRUCTURE, CRITICAL ENERGY
INFRASTRUCTURE STARTING FROM

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.183
OCTOBER TO FREEZE US FROM THE
WINTERTIME.

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:37.690
NOW WE ARE IN THE MIDDLE OF
WINTER, THEY HAVE NO SUCCESS

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:41.728
PRACTICALLY, SO NOW THEY ARE
MOVING THEIR TACTICS INTO

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:44.730
HITTING DIRECTLY THE MULTI
STORY BUILDINGS, THE PRIVATE

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:49.669
HOUSEHOLDS, USING THIS KIND OF
MISSILES, RIGHT YOU ARE, BUT

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:53.806
IT'S NEXT TO IMPOSSIBLE TO
INTERSECT WITH THE AIR DEFENSE

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:59.812
SYSTEM WE ARE NOW IN POSSESSION.
HAD WE HAD ENOUGH WAR

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:05.752
SOPHISTICATED WESTERN TYPE
DEFENSE SYSTEMS, WE WOULD BE

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:10.657
ABLE TO INTERSECT MORE OF THEM,
BUT HAVING WHAT WE HAVE IS

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:14.727
UNFORTUNATELY THE REALITY.
THAT IS WHY MY PRESIDENT IS

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:17.196
TIRELESSLY TALKING TO WORLD
LEADERS.

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:20.300
HE PRACTICALLY STARTED TO DO IT
ON THE FIRST DAY OF THE NEW

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:25.104
YEAR, STARTING HAVING MORE THAN
30 FULL CONVERSATIONS WITH THE

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:28.708
WORLD LEADERS AND NOW IT'S
NUMBER ONE IN THOSE

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:32.078
CONVERSATIONS, WEAPONS, WEAPONS,
WEAPONS.

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:36.683
&gt;&gt; WHAT KIND, A SPECIFICALLY,
OF ANTI MISSILE DEFENSE DO YOU

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:38.050
NEED?
IS IT THE PATRIOTS?

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:43.789
WE KNOW NOW THAT THE UKRAINIAN
TEAMS HAVE BEING TRAINED BY THE

00:03:43.789 --> 00:03:45.257
UNITED STATES, THEY ARE COMING
TO YOU.

00:03:45.257 --> 00:03:47.994
WITH THAT MAKE A DIFFERENCE IN
THIS PARTICULAR CASE?

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:51.931
THIS KIND OF MISSILE?
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:59.739
BY THE WAY, OUR SOLDIERS, THEY
ARE REALLY SMART AND QUICK AND

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:05.812
THEY DON'T NEED THAT TRAINING
AS WE ARE TOLD IN THE

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:08.715
BEGINNING.
BUT THAT SYSTEM IS A

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:12.652
MEDIUM-RANGE SYSTEM COMPARED TO
SHORT-RANGE SYSTEM OF SOME

00:04:12.652 --> 00:04:16.723
WESTERN COUNTRIES WHO HAVE
ALREADY SUPPLIED TO US, LIKE

00:04:16.723 --> 00:04:21.728
IRISH, LIKE OTHER TYPES OF
SYSTEMS, BUT THIS TYPE OF

00:04:21.728 --> 00:04:26.733
SYSTEM IS A MEDIUM-RANGE SYSTEM,
BEING ABLE TO INTERSECT THE

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:30.202
TARGETS ON A MORE LENGTHY
DISTANCE.

00:04:30.202 --> 00:04:36.743
THAT IS WHY IN THE CASE OF THE
MISSILE, THIS SYSTEM WOULD HAVE

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:38.211
INTERSECTED THIS TYPE OF
MISSILE.

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:41.681
THAT'S WHY WE ARE REALLY
THANKFUL FOR THE U.S. AND TO

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:46.686
SOME OTHER COUNTRIES WHO HAVE
DECLARED DELIVERING SUCH TYPES

00:04:46.686 --> 00:04:49.789
OF DEFENSE SYSTEMS.
BUT DEFINITELY WE NEED MORE.

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:55.928
AT LEAST DEFEND EACH MEASURE,
EACH MAJOR INFRASTRUCTURE

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:58.965
ENERGY INFRASTRUCTURE.
&gt;&gt; THE BRITISH SECRETARY TODAY

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:01.768
TOLD PARLIAMENT, ACTUALLY THE
DEFENSE SECRETARY TOLD

00:05:01.768 --> 00:05:04.871
PARLIAMENT THAT A WHOLE NEW
LEVEL OF NATO AND WESTERN AID

00:05:04.871 --> 00:05:08.841
NEEDS TO BE GIVEN TO UKRAINE AT
THIS MAKE-OR-BREAK MOMENT.

00:05:08.841 --> 00:05:14.847
YOU WENT VERY, VERY SPECIFIC.
IT REQUIRES A NEW LEVEL OF

00:05:14.847 --> 00:05:18.718
SUPPORT, COMBAT POWER WHICH CAN
ONLY BE ACHIEVED BY

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:23.089
COMBINATIONS OF BATTLE TANKS
OPERATING ALONGSIDE ARTILLERY

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:26.759
GROUPS AND FURTHERING DEEP
PRECISION FIRES, ENABLING

00:05:26.759 --> 00:05:29.862
TARGETING OF RUSSIAN LOGISTICS
AND COMMANDOES AT GREATER

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:32.665
DISTANCE.
THAT IS FROM BEN WALLACE

00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:34.133
HIMSELF, A MILITARY MAN
FORMALLY.

00:05:34.133 --> 00:05:38.638
THAT IS VERY DETAILED.
THEY ARE SAYING THAT THEY NEED

00:05:38.638 --> 00:05:42.975
A WHOLE NEW BATTLE FORMATION.
ARE YOU GETTING, IS THAT WHAT

00:05:42.975 --> 00:05:44.777
YOU NEED?
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:05:44.777 --> 00:05:49.782
YOU ARE ABSOLUTELY RIGHT.
TO PUT IT MORE SIMPLY, NOTHING

00:05:49.782 --> 00:05:54.887
THAT SOPHISTICATED AS WONDERFUL
A PERSON, REALLY AN EXPERT, AND

00:05:54.887 --> 00:05:59.692
A PROFESSIONAL AT THIS.
IT'S VERY SIMPLE, WE NEED THIS

00:05:59.692 --> 00:06:03.663
TRIAD OF WEAPONS.
APART FROM OUR DEFENSE SYSTEM,

00:06:03.663 --> 00:06:06.966
WHICH WE WILL TALK TO YOU ABOUT,
THIS IS AN ARTILLERY SYSTEM.

00:06:06.966 --> 00:06:11.904
NOT ONLY ARTILLERY SYSTEM,
WESTERN ARTILLERY SYSTEMS, BUT

00:06:11.904 --> 00:06:16.008
THE AMMUNITION.
WE NEED THE AMMUNITION BECAUSE

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:21.681
WE ARE RUNNING OUT OF THE
AMMUNITION FOR THE SOVIET

00:06:21.681 --> 00:06:25.852
WEAPONS.
THIRDLY, WE NEED TANKS AND

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:30.690
THESE ARE VERY IMPORTANT.
THE UK SIDE IS ALREADY MADE,

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:35.728
THE EUROPEAN PARTNERS HAS MADE.
UNFORTUNATELY, WE STILL LACK

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:38.998
SOME COUNTRIES TO MOVE THIS
FINAL DECISIVE STEP.

00:06:38.998 --> 00:06:45.004
THAT IS WHY WE ARE COUNTING ON
THE MEETING AT THE END OF THIS

00:06:45.004 --> 00:06:48.007
WEEK WHERE MORE THAN 50 MINUTES
OF DEFENSE WILL GET TOGETHER

00:06:48.007 --> 00:06:50.877
INCLUDING THE MINISTER OF
DEFENSE OF UKRAINE AND REALLY

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:54.814
COUNT ON THE DECISIVE STEPS AND
ACTIONS TO BE MADE IN THIS

00:06:54.814 --> 00:06:59.718
MEETING, NOT TO HELP UKRAINE,
NOT ONLY TO WITHSTAND THE

00:06:59.718 --> 00:07:03.990
CURRENT ATTACKS OF RUSSIA, BUT
TO MAKE COUNTERATTACKS AND

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.926
COUNTEROFFENSIVE IMMEDIATELY.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU BELIEVE, I THINK YOU

00:07:06.926 --> 00:07:09.829
ARE CALLING OUT GERMANY, WHICH
HAS NOT YET TAKEN A PUBLIC

00:07:09.829 --> 00:07:13.866
DECISION LIKE OTHER EUROPEAN
IDOLIZE FOR THE TANKS AND ALSO

00:07:13.866 --> 00:07:16.902
HAS NOT YET GIVEN OFFICIAL
PERMISSION TO OTHER COUNTRIES,

00:07:16.902 --> 00:07:19.939
WHICH HAVE THOSE SAME TANKS TO
SEND THEM TO YOU, EVEN THOUGH

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:22.708
THAT THEY ARE WILLING TO DO SO,
SUCH AS POLAND.

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:26.846
DO YOU BELIEVE THAT THIS
MINISTRY OF THE U.S. SECRETARY

00:07:26.846 --> 00:07:29.248
OF DEFENSE, OTHERS ARE GOING TO
BE MEETING.

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:31.784
WHAT DO YOU THINK?
YOU HAVE THE DIPLOMATIC

00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:35.788
ADVISOR.
DO YOU HAVE ANY HINT THAT

00:07:35.788 --> 00:07:37.856
GERMANY WILL COME THROUGH LIKE
THE OTHER COUNTRIES HAVE?

00:07:37.856 --> 00:07:42.895
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW TOMORROW IS A VERY
IMPORTANT DAY, THE ANNIVERSARY

00:07:42.895 --> 00:07:46.732
OF DIPLOMATIC RELATIONS BETWEEN
GERMANY.

00:07:46.732 --> 00:07:51.837
BUT RIGHT YOU ARE.
I HAVE A CAUTIOUS OPTIMISM

00:07:51.837 --> 00:07:56.776
ABOUT THE DECISION INCLUDING ON
THE COUNTRY YOU MENTIONED TO BE

00:07:56.776 --> 00:08:02.148
TAKEN THIS FRIDAY DURING THE
MEETING.

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:08.854
REALLY WE HAVE A LOT FROM
GERMANY, BUT SOMETIMES YOU NEED

00:08:08.854 --> 00:08:13.993
TO MAKE THIS VERY IMPORTANT
DECISION TO GAIN THE MOMENTUM.

00:08:13.993 --> 00:08:18.164
REMEMBER WHAT WAS HAPPENING TO
OUR DEFENSES DUMB, SOMEBODY HAS

00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:20.700
TO BE FIRST AND THEN YOU FOLLOW
THEM.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.970
WE WOULD LIKE GERMANY TO MAKE
THIS VERY IMPORTANT STEP.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:28.040
&gt;&gt; IT APPEARS, AND AGAIN YOU
ARE THE DIPLOMATIC ADVISOR,

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:32.778
THAT ANY IDEA OF ANY
NEGOTIATIONS OR SOME KIND OF

00:08:32.778 --> 00:08:35.748
LIGHT AT THE END OF THE TUNNEL
IN TERMS OF A PEACE DEAL, IT'S

00:08:35.748 --> 00:08:38.250
JUST SO FAR OFF, THAT'S WHAT IT
APPEARS LIKE.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:43.756
I WANT TO ASK YOU WHAT YOU MAKE
OF PRESIDENT PUTIN TELLING THE

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:46.759
