ALL BECAUSE OF WESTERN, NATO

00:08:46.759 --> 00:08:49.261
WEAPONS, THEY ARE PROLONGING
THIS.

00:08:49.261 --> 00:08:53.733
THEY HAVE ALREADY BLAMED THE
DNIPRO BUILDING ATTACK ON THE

00:08:53.733 --> 00:08:56.736
UKRAINIAN SUPPLIED MISSILE
DEFENSE SYSTEM SAYING IT WAS

00:08:56.736 --> 00:08:59.939
YOUR MISSILE DEFENSE SYSTEMS
THAT WENT INTO THAT BUILDING.

00:08:59.939 --> 00:09:05.745
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF PUTIN'S
CONVERSATION WITH THE TURKISH

00:09:05.745 --> 00:09:08.080
PRESIDENT?
&gt;&gt; IT'S A FALSE NARRATIVE.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:12.852
I CAN NAME YOU MIGHT MENTION
THE RUSSIANS SAY THAT THIS IS

00:09:12.852 --> 00:09:19.859
UKRAINE, UKRAINE WANTS MORE.
UKRAINIANS ARE DYING, BEING

00:09:19.859 --> 00:09:23.796
WOUNDED AND THEY DON'T WANT ONE
TO HAVE PEACE.

00:09:23.796 --> 00:09:27.866
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY WHO IS
TRYING FOR PEACE, WAS TALKING

00:09:27.866 --> 00:09:32.705
