THE TEN POINT PEACE FORMULA.

00:09:35.107 --> 00:09:38.911
THE PRESIDENT SUGGESTED THAT TO
MANY OF THE WORLD LEADERS AND

00:09:38.911 --> 00:09:42.782
THEY HAVE NOT HAD ANYTHING
AGAINST THIS FROM ANY SINGLE

00:09:42.782 --> 00:09:47.653
