YOU JUST MENTIONED PRESIDENT

00:09:47.653 --> 00:09:49.889
PUTIN HIMSELF.
HE DOES NOT WANT TO TALK ABOUT

00:09:49.889 --> 00:09:53.759
THIS.
THERE IS A FORMULA WITH NINE

00:09:53.759 --> 00:09:57.963
POINTS OF DEPRIVING RUSSIA OF
THE AGGRESSIVE INSTRUMENTS.

00:09:57.963 --> 00:10:04.670
DEPRIVING ALL OF US FROM SUPPLY
FROM UKRAINE IS ALSO

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:05.938
AGGRESSION.
MAKING AN ENVIRONMENTAL

00:10:05.938 --> 00:10:09.842
DISASTER IS ALSO AGGRESSION.
ET CETERA.

00:10:09.842 --> 00:10:13.279
EVEN THE STATUTE OF THE U.N. IS
ALSO AN AGGRESSION.

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:17.249
LET'S COMBINE OUR EFFORTS
TOGETHER TO THE WORLD LEADERS.

00:10:17.249 --> 00:10:22.722
THEN, THAT WILL BRING US TO
PEACE BECAUSE ANY WAR, ANY

00:10:22.722 --> 00:10:25.858
VICTORY ENDS UP AT THE
NEGOTIATION TABLE.

00:10:25.858 --> 00:10:30.062
SHULL &gt;&gt; IGOR ZHOVKVA, CHIEF
DIPLOMATIC ADVISER, THANK YOU

00:10:30.062 --> 00:10:31.697
